.TH "nvme_init_get_log_cross_ctrl_reset" 9 "nvme_init_get_log_cross_ctrl_reset" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_get_log_cross_ctrl_reset \- Initialize passthru command for Cross-Controller Reset
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_get_log_cross_ctrl_reset
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "bool rmc "  ","
.BI "struct nvme_cross_ctrl_reset_log *log "  ","
.BI "__u32 len "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "rmc" 12
Remove Completed (RMC), see \fIenum nvme_cross_ctrl_reset_lsp\fP
.IP "log" 12
User address to store the log page
.IP "len" 12
The allocated length of the log page
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Get Log command with
LID value NVME_LOG_LID_CROSS_CTRL_RESET
